@startuml SD-MAP-03
title SD-MAP-03: Xem trước Lộ trình Dẫn đường Từng bước & Tra cứu Tuyến đường trong Cache

autonumber
actor "Người dùng" as User
participant "Giao diện (Web/Mobile)" as Client
participant "Routes Router\n(FastAPI)" as Router
participant "Routing Service" as RoutingSvc
participant "Route Cache Repo" as CacheRepo
database "MongoDB\n(route_cache)" as CacheDB
participant "OSRM Provider\n(Routing Engine)" as OSRM
participant "POI Repository" as POIRepo

User -> Client: Bấm "Chỉ đường" đến Điểm đến (Destination POI)
Client -> Router: POST /api/v1/routes/preview\n{ origin: {latitude, longitude}, destination_poi_id, mode: "walking", locale: "vi" }
activate Router

Router -> RoutingSvc: calculate_route(origin, dest_poi_id, mode="walking", locale="vi")
activate RoutingSvc

RoutingSvc -> POIRepo: get_by_id(destination_poi_id)
activate POIRepo
POIRepo --> RoutingSvc: poi_doc (chứa location.coordinates [lon, lat])
deactivate POIRepo

RoutingSvc -> RoutingSvc: Lượng tử hóa tọa độ (4 chữ số thập phân ~11m)\nSinh cache fingerprint SHA256(origin + dest + mode + locale)

RoutingSvc -> CacheRepo: get_by_fingerprint(fingerprint)
activate CacheRepo
CacheRepo -> CacheDB: findOne({ fingerprint: ..., expires_at: { $gt: ISODate() } })
activate CacheDB

alt Cache Hit (Đã có lộ trình hợp lệ trong TTL 24h)
    CacheDB --> CacheRepo: route_cache doc
    CacheRepo --> RoutingSvc: Cached RouteResultDTO
else Cache Miss (Chưa có hoặc đã hết hạn TTL)
    CacheDB --> CacheRepo: null
    deactivate CacheDB
    CacheRepo --> RoutingSvc: None
    deactivate CacheRepo

    RoutingSvc -> OSRM: route(origin, destination, mode="walking", locale="vi")
    activate OSRM
    note over OSRM: Gọi OSRM v5 API\nsteps=true, overview=full, geometries=geojson
    OSRM --> RoutingSvc: RouteResultDTO (độ dài thực tế m, thời gian s, geometry LineString, turn-by-turn steps)
    deactivate OSRM

    RoutingSvc -> CacheRepo: save_route(fingerprint, route_data, ttl_hours=24)
    activate CacheRepo
    CacheRepo -> CacheDB: insertOne({ fingerprint, route, expires_at: now + 24h })
    activate CacheDB
    CacheDB --> CacheRepo: Acknowledged
    deactivate CacheDB
    deactivate CacheRepo
end

RoutingSvc --> Router: RouteResultDTO (route_distance_m, route_duration_s, geometry, steps, ...)
deactivate RoutingSvc

Router --> Client: 200 OK (RouteResultDTO)
deactivate Router

Client -> Client: Vẽ Polyline OSRM lên bản đồ\nHiển thị danh sách các bước chỉ đường (Directions Panel)
Client --> User: Người dùng xem chi tiết lộ trình đường bộ thực tế

@enduml
